OL,3,GNEWSABellingham and Rogers orange chips
OL,4,Amural vandalised
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mural of England stars Jude
OL,7,FBellingham and Morgan Rogers eating
OL,8,Forange chips has been vandalised.
OL,10,FThe artwork depicting the Black
OL,11,FCountry-born footballers tucking into
OL,12,Fthe local delicacy, also known as
OL,13,Fbattered chips, resides on the side of
OL,14,Fthe Classic Fryer chippy on Hagley
OL,15,FRoad, Quinton.
OL,17,FIts creator, Dudley artist Dion Kitson,
OL,18,Fposted a photo on his Instagram
OL,19,Faccount, showing that much of the
OL,20,Fartwork of Bellingham had been ripped
OL,21,Foff the wall.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
